{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26120","headline":"恩赐魏文贞公诸孙旧第以𨗳直 · 陈彦博","name":"恩赐魏文贞公诸孙旧第以𨗳直","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阿衡随逝水，池馆主他人。\n天意能酬德，云孙喜庇身。\n生前由直道，殁後振芳尘。\n雨露新恩日，芝兰旧里春。\n勳庸留十代，光彩映诸邻。\n共贺升平日，从兹得谏臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈彦博","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}